%% Custom DevOps Deployment Tool - simple gated workflow
%% Render:  npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i docs/deployment-flow.mmd -o docs/deployment-flow.png
flowchart TD
    Start([Launch DevOps Tool]) --> Load[Load appsettings.json]
    Load --> Env[Determine active environment]
    Env --> Build[1. Build Application]
    Build --> Backup[2. Backup target environment]
    Backup --> Deploy[3. Deploy to SIT]
    Deploy --> Done([Complete])
    Backup -. optional .-> Rollback[4. Rollback]
